sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator as Tenant Admin / assigned Site Manager
    participant UI as Camera & Gate UI
    participant API as Scoped management API
    participant Audit as Tenant/site audit
    participant Edge as Edge appliance
    participant Health as Health / probe service
    participant Map as Parking Map Designer

    Operator->>UI: Submit reviewed site-scoped camera config
    UI->>API: Create provisioned camera + idempotency key
    API->>API: Resolve tenant/site/role and validate gate uniqueness
    API->>Audit: Record provision outcome (no secrets)
    API-->>UI: Camera + one-time enrollment credential
    UI-->>Operator: Reveal once; close permanently after acknowledgement

    Edge->>API: Enroll with per-camera credential
    API->>API: Bind immutable tenant/site/camera principal
    Edge->>Health: Stream metadata / snapshot / heartbeat
    Health->>API: Authenticated health facts
    API-->>UI: Waiting → snapshot verified → first heartbeat

    alt ANPR_GATE
        Operator->>UI: Run OCR sample
        UI->>Health: Start bounded OCR test
        Health-->>UI: Detection result or sanitized recovery
    else OVERVIEW
        Operator->>UI: Run coverage test
        UI->>Health: Start bounded coverage test
        Health-->>UI: Coverage result or sanitized recovery
        Health->>API: Publish eligibility projection
        Map->>API: List eligible Overview cameras for selected site
        API-->>Map: Authorized eligible inputs + ineligible reasons
    end

    Note over UI,API: Browser selection never expands server-resolved site authority
    Note over API,Audit: Rotate/revoke/disable/replace require reason and atomic audit outcome

